                  </row>
                  <row>
                     <cell> </cell>
                     <cell>      And here a Gee, and there a Gee,</cell>
                  </row>
                  <row>
                     <cell> </cell>
                     <cell>      And everywhere a Gee;</cell>
                  </row>
                  <row>
                     <cell>Says I,</cell>
                     <cell>My pretty lass, will you come to the banks of the Aire oh?</cell>
                  </row>
